OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate reports of girl
OL,4,Abeing followed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have appealed for witnesses
OL,7,Fafter receiving reports of a girl in
OL,8,Fschool uniform being followed by an
OL,9,Funknown man.
OL,11,FGuernsey Police said officers were
OL,12,Finvestigating an incident involving a
OL,13,F"juvenile female" near Les Beaucamps
OL,14,FHigh School in Castel between 15:30 and
OL,15,F16:30 GMT on Wednesday.
OL,17,FThe force said the suspect is described
OL,18,Fas white, in his late teens or early
OL,19,F20s, about 5ft 5in (1.65m) tall, with
OL,20,Fblonde hair and wearing a grey and navy
OL,21,Ftracksuit.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
